titel = "Hay Wain"
description = "The farmer lashes the last bundle and slaps the wheel. \"Goblin stables, the long barn. Tell them Halfling second-cut. They'll stop boiling boot-leather for the she-beasts.\"

Straw sticks in your lead mare's mane all the way out of the lane."
